FString MaterialHash(const UStaticMesh* Mesh){FHash H;H.Int(Mesh->GetStaticMaterials().Num());for(const auto& M:Mesh->GetStaticMaterials()){H.Text(M.MaterialSlotName.ToString());H.Text(M.ImportedMaterialSlotName.ToString());H.Text(M.MaterialInterface?M.MaterialInterface->GetPathName():TEXT("null"));}return H.End();}

// Actual decoded packed render values are compared by their float32 bit
// patterns; duplicate/coincident faces remain multisets, never nearest matches.
struct FRenderRow {TArray<uint32> Bits;};
uint32 FloatBits(float F){uint32 U;FMemory::Memcpy(&U,&F,sizeof(U));return U;}
float BitsFloat(uint32 U){float F;FMemory::Memcpy(&F,&U,sizeof(F));return F;}
void PushVector(TArray<uint32>& R,const FVector3f& V){R.Add(FloatBits(V.X));R.Add(FloatBits(V.Y));R.Add(FloatBits(V.Z));}
void PushVector(TArray<uint32>& R,const FVector4f& V){R.Add(FloatBits(V.X));R.Add(FloatBits(V.Y));R.Add(FloatBits(V.Z));R.Add(FloatBits(V.W));}
int32 CompareBits(const TArray<uint32>& A,const TArray<uint32>& B){const int32 Count=FMath::Min(A.Num(),B.Num());for(int32 I=0;I<Count;++I)if(A[I]!=B[I])return A[I]<B[I]?-1:1;return A.Num()==B.Num()?0:(A.Num()<B.Num()?-1:1);}
FRenderRow CyclicRow(int32 Material,int32 UVCount,const TArray<uint32> (&Corners)[3]){FRenderRow Best;for(int32 Rotation=0;Rotation<3;++Rotation){FRenderRow Row;Row.Bits={uint32(Material),uint32(UVCount)};for(int32 K=0;K<3;++K)Row.Bits.Append(Corners[(K+Rotation)%3]);if(Best.Bits.IsEmpty()||CompareBits(Row.Bits,Best.Bits)<0)Best=MoveTemp(Row);}return Best;}
void SortRows(TArray<FRenderRow>& Rows){Rows.Sort([](const FRenderRow& A,const FRenderRow& B){return CompareBits(A.Bits,B.Bits)<0;});}
FString RowHash(const TArray<FRenderRow>& Rows){FHash H;H.Int(Rows.Num());for(const auto& Row:Rows){H.Int(Row.Bits.Num());for(uint32 U:Row.Bits)H.Int(int32(U));}return H.End();}
struct FExpectedFrame {FVector3f Normal,Tangent;float Sign=1;};
struct FComputedFrame {FVector4f X,Z;};
struct FComputedTriangle {FString Corners[3];FComputedFrame Frames[3];int32 RenderMultiplicity=0,MDMultiplicity=0;bool Ambiguous=false;};
bool SameFrame(const FComputedFrame& A,const FComputedFrame& B){return FloatBits(A.X.X)==FloatBits(B.X.X)&&FloatBits(A.X.Y)==FloatBits(B.X.Y)&&FloatBits(A.X.Z)==FloatBits(B.X.Z)&&FloatBits(A.X.W)==FloatBits(B.X.W)&&FloatBits(A.Z.X)==FloatBits(B.Z.X)&&FloatBits(A.Z.Y)==FloatBits(B.Z.Y)&&FloatBits(A.Z.Z)==FloatBits(B.Z.Z)&&FloatBits(A.Z.W)==FloatBits(B.Z.W);}
FString CyclicText(const FString& Slot,const FString (&Corners)[3]){FString Best;for(int32 I=0;I<3;++I){const FString Row=Slot+TEXT("|")+Corners[I]+TEXT("|")+Corners[(I+1)%3]+TEXT("|")+Corners[(I+2)%3];if(Best.IsEmpty()||Row<Best)Best=Row;}return Best;}

